        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Franchot Tone, Frederic March, Frances Drake, Elsa Lanchester\n- Films: One Foot in Heaven, Les Misérables\n- Topics: cast identification, film recognition\n\nFacts:\n- Frederic March won the Academy Award for his starring role in One Foot in Heaven.\n- Frederic March also co-starred in the 1935 American drama film Les Misérables.\n- Frances Drake is best known for her role in the 1935 American drama film Les Misérables.\n- Elsa Lanchester's husband was Charles Laughton.\n- Charles Laughton also co-starred in the 1935 American drama film Les Misérables.",
